    ],
    "notes": [
      "K1 uses the two short exposed outer faces at the northeastern corner. The broad reading bound reflects the shorter arm.",
      "The plan differentiates exposed walls from unexposed gaps and trench boundaries. Gaps are not scored as removal.",
      "The source says SCALE = 2 CM = 5 M. A graphic metre bar is absent, so no metre lengths are derived from nominal printed centimetres.",
      "The separate residential sequence describes infill in earlier open space (OP10, pp. 85-86), but its illustration is an oblique photograph."
